---
description: Read the canonical handoff at both session bookends
alwaysApply: true
---

At session start and after the final closing commit, run this repository's bound
`.overseer/bin/ok -C /absolute/repository next` with the intended lane. Display its
validated output including the model. A refusal is not a prompt to reconstruct
from HANDOVER, ROADMAP, chat history or open tabs. Only explicit next-write with
current context and expected whole-file digest publishes a successor. Host lifecycle
adapters are opt-in and require an owner-selected supported host/event format.
